# __APP_NAME__

A Winia application generated by Winia Forge.

## Desktop

```bash
cargo run
```

## Android

The Android project lives in `android/`. Until `winia build --target android` is implemented, build the
native library manually:

```bash
export ANDROID_NDK=<sdk>/ndk/27.0.12077973
export LIBCLANG_PATH=<llvm>/bin
export RUSTFLAGS="-C link-arg=-Wl,-z,max-page-size=16384"

cargo build --target aarch64-linux-android --lib
mkdir -p android/app/src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a
cp target/aarch64-linux-android/debug/lib__LIB_NAME__.so android/app/src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/
cd android
./gradlew assembleDebug
adb install -r app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk
```
